// Tamga Classifier — gRPC API of the prompt-injection classifier service.
//
// Unlike the analyzer, this service is on the decision path: the proxy calls
// it inline, under a short deadline, when its own rules found nothing
// conclusive. It runs a local ONNX model on CPU and holds no other state.
//
// A second, optional model matches text against topics the operator wrote
// down (ClassifyTopics). Each model is loaded or not on its own; a missing
// topic model does not affect Classify.
//
// A third, optional model is a shadow: a candidate injection model that
// scores every text Classify scores, next to the model in service. Its
// scores are returned for the caller to record and compare; they are not a
// verdict, and a missing or slow shadow does not affect the primary scores.

